==Overview==
The Quad Rocket Shield Toilet is a very strong toilet that appears after wave 100 in the [[Endless Mode]]. This unit is really hard to defeat because slowing units such as [[Green Laser Cameraman]], [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], and [[Chef TV Man]] does not slow this toilet.
==Strategies==
You can deal more damage/defeat this toilet if you:
*Use the boost of [[Mech Bunny Titan]], it can make your high DPS [[Units]] with less cooldown. 
*Titan Fanman's push ability. This can make the toilet slower to move.
*[[Titan Clock Man]] or [[Large Clockman]] time stop. This gives time for the high DPS [[Units]] such as [[Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] or [[Upgraded Titan Drill Man]] to damage the units. [[Upgraded Titan Clockman]] also works.
*[[DJ TV Man]] will have a big impact on the damage your [[Units]] do. 
*Recommended units: [[Godly]] (except Titan Present Man, Aquatitan Speakerman), [[Ultimate]], and depending on your unit, [[Exclusive|Exclusives]].
*Time stopping and Titan Fanman's push is recommended because the longer the time stop is, the farther will the toilet get pushed back.
